# Pipeline Builder — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. Never commit real values.
#
# No variables are required. The app calls the LLM proxy on its own origin (/api/*): in
# development Vite forwards /api/ to `wrangler dev` on http://localhost:8787 (`pnpm dev` starts
# both). Users enter their provider API keys in the app; the proxy never needs one of its own.
